<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Criss-Cross Intervals (2 of 2)</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-12min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 8 x (2min @ 83% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6) + 2min @ 105% FTP (Z5, RPE 8-9))
- 1min @ 83% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6)
-Cadence: 90-100rpm (efficient cadence)
-Position: Alternate seated/standing every other interval

COOL-DOWN:
-8min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 3/6: Development - Standard training load, building consistency
-Faster oscillation with wider power gap. Demanding mentally and physically

EXECUTION:
-Focus on consistent effort and good form throughout.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="720" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="120" Power="0.83" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" />
